# OG images are build artifacts — per-event OGs (images/og/) are regenerated
# when missing and the homepage OG (images/og-home.jpg) is regenerated every
# build. All other images (business flyers) ARE committed so a fresh checkout
# can build the site without running extraction, and so historical flyers
# persist even when a source page stops advertising the event.
public/images/og/
public/images/og-home.jpg
public/index.html
public/index.md
public/llms.txt
public/*.css
.DS_Store
*.log
